      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe as written.\n\n- **Dose:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum labeled prescription dose for adults is 3,200 mg/day, so this is twice that.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg in one dose is also twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risks:** At this level the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up a lot. Pain relief doesn't improve above the usual dosing.\n\nYou may have meant one of these:\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the maximum for this patient.\n- **800 mg by mouth, 3 times daily** (2,400 mg/day), a common dose for inflammatory conditions.\n- **400\u2013600 mg by mouth, every 6 hours**, a typical dose for pain or fever.\n- **1600 mg/day total**, for example 400 mg four times daily or 800 mg twice daily.\n\nTell me which dose you want, or confirm that 1600 mg four times daily is intended. If it is, I'll need a clinical reason to put in the order note. I'll enter it as soon as I have your answer."
      }
     ],
